<title>NORWAY: Statoil charters product carrier.</title>
<headline>Statoil charters product carrier.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil ) said on Thursday it had chartered the product and chemical carrier Monte Bello for two years.</p>
<p>The 14,000-deadweight-tonne vessel is under construction at Italy's Cantiere Orlando-Leghorn yard and is due for delivery in May.</p>
<p>Statoil said the vessel met the company's requirements for double hull, bow thruster and submerged pumps, and will be able to load up to six different products simultaneously.</p>
<p>Marittima Fluviale di Navigazione of Savona owns the ship.</p>
<p>--Tanya Pang, Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
